---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const services = [
  ['Direct hire & retained search','Permanent recruiting for individual contributors, leaders and hard-to-source specialists.'],
  ['Contract staffing','Flexible contract and contract-to-hire staffing for launches, backfills and surge capacity.'],
  ['Executive recruiting','Focused leadership search with market mapping, role calibration and confidential outreach.'],
  ['Talent representation','Candidate-side representation built around fit, trajectory, compensation context and long-term opportunity.'],
  ['Interview operations','Structured screening, scheduling, scorecards, feedback loops and candidate communication.'],
  ['Talent intelligence','Market maps, compensation signals, pipeline health and search strategy before a requisition goes stale.']
];
const specialties = ['Software Engineering','Cloud, Platform & SRE','Data & AI','Cybersecurity','Product & Design','Technical Leadership','Operations','Go-to-market'];
const process = [['Scout','Map the market, sharpen the brief and identify the real talent pool.'],['Verify','Pressure-test evidence, motivation, constraints and mutual expectations.'],['Place','Run a clean handoff through interviews, references, offer alignment and onboarding.'],['Stand watch','Keep signal flowing after placement: retention risk, next hires and capacity gaps.']];
---
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
  <meta name="description" content="Austin, Texas talent agency and staffing firm for direct hire, contract staffing, executive search and technical recruiting." />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0b151b" />
  <link rel="icon" href={`${base}brand/sentinel-mark.svg`} />
  <title>Sentinel Agency — Austin talent search & staffing</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href={`${base}site.css`} />
</head>
<body>
<header class="nav"><a class="brand" href={base}><img src={`${base}brand/sentinel-mark.svg`} alt=""/><span><b>SENTINEL</b><small>AGENCY</small></span></a><nav><a href="#services">Services</a><a href="#industries">Industries</a><a href="#talent">For talent</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a></nav></header>
<main>
<section class="hero wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">AUSTIN, TEXAS · SEARCH / STAFFING / REPRESENTATION</p><h1>Find the people who can <em>see around corners.</em></h1><p class="lede">Sentinel Agency scouts, verifies and places high-signal talent for teams that cannot afford a blind spot. Direct hire, retained search, contract staffing, executive recruiting, candidate representation and talent intelligence.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="#contact">Build your team →</a><a class="btn" href="#talent">Join our talent network →</a></div><p class="location">Headquartered in <strong>Austin, Texas</strong> · serving employers and talent nationwide.</p></div><div class="visual"><div class="rings"></div><img src={`${base}brand/sentinel-mark.svg`} alt="Sentinel Agency outpost logo"/></div></section>
<div class="ticker"><span>DIRECT HIRE</span><i>✦</i><span>CONTRACT STAFFING</span><i>✦</i><span>EXECUTIVE SEARCH</span><i>✦</i><span>TALENT REPRESENTATION</span><i>✦</i><span>MARKET MAPPING</span></div>
<section id="services" class="wrap section"><p class="eyebrow">MISSION SET</p><div class="split"><h2>One agency.<br/>Multiple ways to deploy.</h2><p>Good staffing is not a résumé relay. We combine search craft, structured qualification, candidate care and market intelligence so both sides get a sharper signal earlier.</p></div><div class="cards">{services.map(([title,text],i)=><article><span>0{i+1}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p></article>)}</div></section>
<section id="industries" class="wrap section two"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHO WE SERVE</p><h2>Technical depth without tunnel vision.</h2><p>We support startups, growth companies and enterprise teams — especially when the role is difficult, urgent, confidential or changing as the market teaches us more.</p></div><div class="list">{specialties.map((s,i)=><div><span>{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><b>{s}</b><i>↗</i></div>)}</div></section>
<section class="wrap section"><p class="eyebrow">FIELD PROTOCOL</p><div class="split"><h2>Search with a point of view.</h2><p>Our process is designed to reduce false positives, shorten feedback loops and keep candidates informed instead of treating the pipeline like a black box.</p></div><div class="steps">{process.map(([t,p],i)=><article><span>0{i+1}</span><h3>{t}</h3><p>{p}</p></article>)}</div></section>
<section class="wrap lanes"><article><p class="eyebrow">FOR EMPLOYERS</p><h2>Your next hire should change the slope.</h2><p>Bring us the hard role: unclear market, competing priorities, compressed timeline or a team that has already interviewed a dozen almost-right people.</p><ul><li>Role calibration and search strategy</li><li>Target-company and talent mapping</li><li>Structured candidate evidence packets</li><li>Interview, references and offer support</li></ul></article><article id="talent" class="light"><p class="eyebrow">FOR TALENT</p><h2>Representation, not résumé forwarding.</h2><p>We want to understand the work you actually want, where you are strongest, what tradeoffs matter and which companies are worth your attention.</p><ul><li>Role-fit and trajectory calibration</li><li>Selective, permission-based introductions</li><li>Interview and positioning support</li><li>Offer-context and negotiation support</li></ul></article></section>
<section class="wrap section faq"><p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p><h2>What companies and candidates usually ask.</h2><details open><summary>Where is Sentinel Agency based?</summary><p>Austin, Texas, with recruiting support for employers and candidates across the United States.</p></details><details><summary>Do you handle permanent and contract roles?</summary><p>Yes — direct hire, retained and contingent search, contract staffing and contract-to-hire.</p></details><details><summary>Which functions do you recruit for?</summary><p>Software, infrastructure, data, AI, security, product, design, operations, technical leadership and adjacent business roles.</p></details><details><summary>Can candidates join before there is an immediate opening?</summary><p>Yes. Long-term candidate relationships and representation are central to the Sentinel model.</p></details></section>
<section id="contact" class="wrap cta"><div><p class="eyebrow">OPEN A CHANNEL</p><h2>Tell us what you are trying to build.</h2><p>Sentinel Agency is launching its Austin recruiting and staffing operation now. Employer and candidate intake systems are coming online with the agency platform.</p></div><a class="btn primary" href="https://github.com/sentinel-agency">Contact Sentinel ↗</a></section>
</main>
<footer class="wrap footer"><a class="brand" href={base}><img src={`${base}brand/sentinel-mark.svg`} alt=""/><span><b>SENTINEL</b><small>AGENCY</small></span></a><p>Austin, Texas · Search · Staffing · Representation · Talent Intelligence</p><small>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Sentinel Agency</small></footer>
</body>
</html>
